WEBVTT

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.796
- (Crimp grunts)
- (Rhonda purrs)

00:00:08.931 --> 00:00:11.266
Oh, it looks like
you need a hug.

00:00:11.401 --> 00:00:12.466
(Rhonda panting)

00:00:12.601 --> 00:00:14.166
(Crimp sobbing)

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:18.973
Okay, now,
whose sibling is this, now?

00:00:20.637 --> 00:00:23.071
PUTT PUTT TROLLS (chanting):
Bergens! Bergens!

00:00:23.207 --> 00:00:25.480
Bergens! Bergens! Bergens!

00:00:25.615 --> 00:00:27.277
Bridgey, loving you is

00:00:27.412 --> 00:00:29.345
the best thing
that ever happened to me.

00:00:29.481 --> 00:00:32.954
Um, would it be weird
if we made out?

00:00:33.089 --> 00:00:36.122
Babe, it would be weird
if we didn't.

00:00:36.257 --> 00:00:39.191
- (smooching loudly)
- ("Bergens" chant fades)

00:00:45.898 --> 00:00:47.769
(both yelling)

00:00:47.905 --> 00:00:49.932
- VIVA: Wait!
- (mechanical creaking)

00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:51.434
- (gasps)
- Huh?

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:01.380
Is this you?

00:01:01.516 --> 00:01:02.618
Hey.

00:01:02.753 --> 00:01:04.682
That's me and my best friend.

00:01:04.818 --> 00:01:06.721
(sighs) Yeah.

00:01:06.856 --> 00:01:09.956
Poppy, she... she's my sister.

00:01:10.092 --> 00:01:12.088
You're Poppy's sister? (gasps)

00:01:12.223 --> 00:01:14.389
That makes us best friends, too.

00:01:14.525 --> 00:01:16.694
Yeah, she told me
about your wedding.

00:01:16.829 --> 00:01:17.992
Congratulations.

00:01:18.128 --> 00:01:19.564
Thanks, girl.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:20.932
(sighs)

00:01:21.068 --> 00:01:22.769
I think I made a huge mistake.

00:01:22.904 --> 00:01:23.969
GRISTLE:
It's fine.

00:01:24.105 --> 00:01:25.469
We're not gonna press charges.

00:01:25.604 --> 00:01:27.571
I don't think
that's what she means.

00:01:27.707 --> 00:01:30.242
Yeah, no, that's not
what I'm talking about.

00:01:30.377 --> 00:01:32.680
So, you're really not
gonna eat us?

00:01:32.816 --> 00:01:35.078
No, but I understand the fear.

00:01:35.213 --> 00:01:37.852
If you want, I can open my mouth

00:01:37.988 --> 00:01:40.249
and you can take
tiny steps toward it,

00:01:40.384 --> 00:01:42.921
letting yourself
feel and breathe

00:01:43.057 --> 00:01:45.653
your way through the anxiety.

00:01:45.789 --> 00:01:49.628
It's called
systematic desensitization.

00:01:49.763 --> 00:01:52.027
Ah... ah...

00:01:52.162 --> 00:01:54.031
Or I let you go

00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:57.066
and you promise not to eat us.

00:01:57.202 --> 00:01:59.205
Oh, that's fine, too.

00:02:01.075 --> 00:02:02.572
KID RITZ:
All right, Rageons.

00:02:02.707 --> 00:02:05.180
Now is the moment
we've all been waiting for.

00:02:05.316 --> 00:02:08.247
Everyone, put your hands up
for Lifer Award recipients,

00:02:08.382 --> 00:02:11.580
that tantalizing twosome,
Velvet and Veneer!

00:02:11.715 --> 00:02:14.756
♪ If the top is
where you want to stay ♪

00:02:14.891 --> 00:02:17.557
♪ You gotta work hard... ♪

00:02:17.692 --> 00:02:19.288
I love you!

00:02:19.423 --> 00:02:21.055
- Thank you.
- (chuckling)

00:02:21.191 --> 00:02:23.224
We love you, too.

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:24.559
Okay, how's my aura?

00:02:24.694 --> 00:02:26.197
Confident, yet grateful
to your teachers

00:02:26.333 --> 00:02:27.901
and everyone
who got you here tonight.

00:02:28.037 --> 00:02:29.603
That's what I'm going for.

00:02:29.738 --> 00:02:31.303
(fans cheering)

00:02:31.438 --> 00:02:33.705
FAN: Velvet,
can I get a picture, please?

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:35.303
(both squealing)

00:02:35.439 --> 00:02:37.680
♪ I'm amazing... ♪

00:02:37.815 --> 00:02:39.947
- (roaring)
- (song stops)

00:02:40.083 --> 00:02:41.445
- (crowd gasping)
- (Velvet and Veneer yelp)

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:43.447
BRANCH (over speaker):
Velvet and Veneer!

00:02:44.281 --> 00:02:46.048
Give me back my brothers.

00:02:46.184 --> 00:02:47.717
Yeah. What he said.

00:02:47.853 --> 00:02:49.817
You don't know what you're
talking about, troll.

00:02:49.952 --> 00:02:51.555
You're stealing BroZone's talent
because you have

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:55.229
none of your own, you big...
oh, you big phonies!

00:02:55.364 --> 00:02:58.528
- (crowd gasping, murmuring)
- (cameras clicking)

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:01.166
(both chuckling nervously)

00:03:01.302 --> 00:03:04.204
Okay, we need to leave
right now.

00:03:07.177 --> 00:03:09.440
("Sweet Dreams
(Are Made of This)" playing)

00:03:09.575 --> 00:03:12.146
- Follow that luxury vehicle!
- On it, Poppy.

00:03:22.389 --> 00:03:24.423
VELVET:
What's up, Mount Rageous?

00:03:24.558 --> 00:03:26.256
You didn't think
we were just gonna give you

00:03:26.391 --> 00:03:28.361
a boring old stage show,
did you?

00:03:28.496 --> 00:03:31.330
That's what we explicitly
bought tickets for.

00:03:31.465 --> 00:03:34.899
We're taking this show
on the road!

00:03:35.034 --> 00:03:37.037
(fans cheering)

00:03:37.173 --> 00:03:39.073
Oh, man.
I'm trying to get through,

00:03:39.208 --> 00:03:41.607
but they got no respect
for the blinker.

00:03:41.742 --> 00:03:43.144
(beeping)

00:03:46.979 --> 00:03:49.381
(whirring)

00:03:50.181 --> 00:03:52.252
(all groaning)

00:03:53.718 --> 00:03:56.923
♪ Sweet dreams
are made of this ♪

00:03:57.058 --> 00:04:00.525
♪ Who am I to disagree? ♪

00:04:00.661 --> 00:04:04.232
♪ I traveled the world
and the seven seas ♪

00:04:04.367 --> 00:04:08.701
♪ Everybody's looking
for something ♪

00:04:08.836 --> 00:04:10.331
(whooshing)

00:04:10.466 --> 00:04:13.039
Oh! This is too much.

00:04:13.174 --> 00:04:14.270
I only have my learner's permit.

00:04:14.406 --> 00:04:16.474
Ugh. Tiny, give me the thing.

00:04:16.609 --> 00:04:18.740
- What thing?
- You know, the thing-thing.

00:04:18.875 --> 00:04:20.011
- (mumbles "I don't know")
- Come on, Tiny.

00:04:20.147 --> 00:04:21.613
Don't do me like that.

00:04:21.748 --> 00:04:24.086
(chuckles) Yeah, I knew
what you was talking about.

00:04:24.919 --> 00:04:26.721
(sucking noisily)

00:04:26.857 --> 00:04:28.088
Oh. Oh, that's good.

00:04:28.223 --> 00:04:29.385
POPPY:
Branch, there they are!

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:33.162
♪ Some of them want to use you ♪

00:04:33.297 --> 00:04:35.359
♪ Some of them want
to get used by you ♪

00:04:35.495 --> 00:04:38.067
- (screams)
- Hold her steady, Tiny.

00:04:38.202 --> 00:04:40.597
♪ Some of them
want to abuse you ♪

00:04:40.732 --> 00:04:44.499
♪ Some of them want
to be abused ♪

00:04:44.634 --> 00:04:46.539
- Branch.
- Hang tight, Floyd.

00:04:46.675 --> 00:04:48.636
- We'll get you guys out of here.
- ♪ Moving on ♪

00:04:48.772 --> 00:04:50.340
- Oh!
- ♪ Hold your head up ♪

00:04:50.475 --> 00:04:52.445
♪ Moving on, keep your head up ♪

00:04:52.581 --> 00:04:54.815
♪ Moving on,
hold your head up, moving on ♪

00:04:54.951 --> 00:04:56.283
♪ Keep your head up... ♪

00:04:56.419 --> 00:04:58.714
Uh, guys, what does
"end of the road" mean?

00:05:00.724 --> 00:05:03.389
(all screaming)

00:05:06.797 --> 00:05:07.893
(Rhonda sputters, roars)

00:05:08.028 --> 00:05:12.600
♪ Yeah... ♪

00:05:12.735 --> 00:05:13.628
♪ Fame ♪

00:05:13.763 --> 00:05:16.264
♪ I'm gonna live forever ♪

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:17.632
(Rhonda sputtering)

00:05:17.768 --> 00:05:20.476
♪ I'm gonna learn how to fly ♪

00:05:20.611 --> 00:05:21.470
♪ High ♪

00:05:21.606 --> 00:05:24.539
♪ I feel it coming together ♪

00:05:24.675 --> 00:05:26.814
♪ People will see me and cry ♪

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:28.044
BRANCH:
Oh, no.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.211
What do we do?

00:05:29.346 --> 00:05:30.719
Let's hustle!

00:05:30.855 --> 00:05:32.814
- (grunts)
- (whooshing)

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:35.785
Hey, it's Hustle Man.

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:37.823
Can you please drop us off
at that boat down there?

00:05:37.959 --> 00:05:40.188
Abso-hustle-y!

00:05:40.324 --> 00:05:43.231
Not literally!

